[I] Jakarta Commons Lang

[T] The Lang Component provides a host of helper utilities for the
[T] java.lang API, notably String manipulation methods, basic numerical
[T] methods, object reflection, creation and serialization, and System
[T] properties. Additionally it contains an inheritable enum type, an
[T] exception structure that supports multiple types of nested-Exceptions,
[T] basic enhancements to java.util.Date and a series of utlities
[T] dedicated to help with building methods, such as hashCode, toString
[T] and equals.

[U] https://commons.apache.org/proper/commons-lang/

[A] Apache Jakarta Commons team
[M] Minto van der Sluis <minto@multimach.com>

[C] extra/development

[L] OpenSource
[V] 3.21.0

